        "description": "1. The **cart** will eventually stop at some point, and press a button providing electrical charge to a **rail**.\n2. Pull it out, and jump ahead of it.\n3. Push it to just below the **rail**, then climb the **cart** and **rail**, and then finally, run to the right before the **cart** strikes the button again.",
